  "details": "Version: VRChat 2020.1.1\nDescription of the bug: I have an HTC Vive. When I open VRChat, I can't push any buttons. The trigger does nothing, the menu button does nothing, the touchpad does nothing. The controller position is still tracked properly, and I can push buttons in SteamVR and in other games, this bug only happens in VRChat. If I open the desktop mode then I can walk around and navigate the menus fine. I've already tried restarting my computer, deleting VRChat temp files and registry keys, and verifying game files. I don't have any controllers connected.\nSteps to reproduce: Open VRChat and I can't push any buttons.",
